def assign_shard(worker_ids: dict, job_id: str) -> str:
    # worker_ids: dict[str, WorkerInfo] — pick the first idle worker
    for worker_id, info in worker_ids.items():
        if info.idle:
            return worker_id
    raise NoIdleWorkers()
```
Used by a scheduler that must deterministically re-derive the same assignment when replaying job history from a log.

